@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title AWS deployment trust boundaries
package "GitHub" {
  rectangle "Untrusted PR run" as PR
  rectangle "Protected sandbox deployment job" as JOB
}
package "AWS sandbox account" {
  rectangle "OIDC provider: exact aud and sub" as IDP
  rectangle "Scoped deploy role" as ROLE
  rectangle "S3 Terraform state (locked)" as STATE
  rectangle "Lambda function + alias" as LAMBDA
}
PR -[hidden]-> JOB
JOB --> IDP : short-lived JWT
IDP --> ROLE : AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
ROLE --> STATE : read/write scoped key
ROLE --> LAMBDA : reviewed change
note left of PR
No id-token/cloud deployment rights
end note
@enduml
